# Main (AGENTS.md adapter)

Read `AGENTS.md` before editing. Product brief: `AGENT.md`. Parent: `edwardlthompson/agent-project-bootstrap` @ `.template-version`.

## Invariants

- FOSS MIT; config-driven behaviour under `config/`
- Max 300 lines static data, 150 lines pure logic
- Conventional Commits; never commit secrets or `.env`
- Every agent/auto_safe fix needs a `gate`
- Prefer PRs; never delete repos or force-push

## Commands

Type `/` for slash commands (`docs/help/BATCH_COMMANDS.md`). Gates:

```bash
python scripts/agent-run.py verify
# or: bash scripts/verify.sh / powershell -File scripts/verify.ps1
argus doctor
```

`/push` and `/ship` need `[HUMAN]` approval (hooks denylist git push).

